<!---
    Rendered when the Bloomreach service call fails. Per spec: never
    silently show unrelated products on failure.
--->
<div class="boot-finder-results-grid boot-finder-results-grid--error">
    ${Resource.msg('bootfinder.results.error', 'bootfinder', 'We could not load boot matches right now. Please try again in a moment.')}
</div>
